WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Run the released C0010 blueprint synthesis command.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Four requirements come from STIX fields and curated rules.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
The generated blueprint specifies one Linux target host.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
The blueprint requests a private lab without host or Internet access.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
The output binds to its source constraints; no host was booted.
